    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d666-a3">

                <pb facs="1141" n="1041" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg1041"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 274.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr.
                            Saavedra.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 7,
                        1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    that your excellency’s note of the 24th ultimo, in relation to the case of Mr.
                    John E. Wheelock, was received by me on the 26th ultimo. I will only add at
                    present that the note in question will be brought by the earliest opportunity to
                    the attention and consideration of my government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JEHU BAKER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
